header_text {
  translation {
    text: "Route 17 Proposed Service Change:"
    language: "en"
  }
}
description_text {
  translation {
    text: "Minor changes to weekday, Saturday and Sunday/Holiday schedules, and adapt the eastbound routing near Oak Station to streamline the path and eliminate inefficient left turns. The proposed pattern would operate from stop 12979, West Colfax and Simms Street, turning right on Oak Street and right on West Rail Road to serve Oak Station, turning left on Quail Street, and continuing to Federal Center Station.\r\n\nReason: Improve improve on-time performance, service reliability, and transfers with Route 16 by strengthening connections at Oak Station, creating a more efficient and consistent route alignment.\r\n\n\r\nCustomer feedback on the Proposed June Service Changes will be collected through March 4. We invite you to virtually attend our public meetings and Ask a Service Planner session, or share your feedback through the online survey. Customer feedback is important to RTD, and we thank you for participating however you can!\r\n\nOnline feedback survey: https://rtddenver.qualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV_5vWH1ee1H4rliHs"
    language: "en"
  }
}
